---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Online Protractor Tool"
  description="Privacy policy for the Online Protractor tool detailing client-side data handling, cookies, and local execution."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-10 space-y-8 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Effective Date: October 19, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100">1. Client-Side Processing Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        Online Protractor operates entirely within your web browser. All geometric calculations, degree measurements, image uploads, and live camera streams are executed locally on your client hardware. We do not store, process, or transmit your images or camera feeds to external servers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100">2. Camera & Photo Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        When you enable the camera feature, the application requests temporary access via your browser’s standard MediaDevices API. This video stream exists solely in memory during your active session. Revoking camera permission or closing the browser tab terminates the stream immediately.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100">3. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Like standard web platforms, our CDN provider (Cloudflare) records basic server logs including IP address, browser type, referring pages, and access timestamps. These logs diagnose connectivity issues and protect the website against automated abuse.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100">4. Advertising & Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this website or other sites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-100">5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, contact us at <code class="text-sky-400 font-mono">contact@onlineprotractor.pages.dev</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
